# FocusList frontend environment.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` to override the defaults. All variables are
# optional — the app works out of the box without a `.env` file:
#   - In development, Vite proxies `/api` to the backend on :8000.
#   - In production, API calls go to `/api` on the same origin as the app.
#
# Set this ONLY when your API lives on another origin (e.g. a separate API
# domain). Trailing slashes are allowed and stripped at runtime.
# VITE_API_URL=/api
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api